# Tech Stack

Source of truth: `BUILD_SPEC.md` §2.

| Concern | Use |
|---------|-----|
| App | React Native + Expo (managed) + Expo Router + TypeScript |
| Timer UI | `react-native-reanimated` v3, `react-native-svg`, `react-native-gesture-handler` |
| State | Zustand (or Context if still tiny) |
| Local data | `expo-sqlite` for tasks/sessions; AsyncStorage only for simple settings |
| Backend | Supabase Auth + Postgres + RLS (`auth.uid()`) |
| Charts | `victory-native` or custom SVG |
| Notify | `expo-notifications` |
| Test | Jest + RNTL (timer math + estimator stats) |
| Ship | EAS Build / Submit |

Do not introduce Redux, heavy UI kits, Firebase (unless explicitly chosen over Supabase), or a custom auth server.
Do not make the live timer wait on network I/O.
